  | bb1:0.5! bb1:0.25+ bb1:0.25 d2:0.25 f2:0.25+ bb1:0.25 r:0.25 bb1:0.5! f1:0.25+ bb1:0.25 c2:0.25+ bb1:0.25 a1:0.5! |
  | r:0.25 a1:0.25+ e2:0.25 a1:0.25 r:0.25 a1:0.25+ e2:0.25 a1:0.25 c#2:0.5! a1:0.25+ e1:0.25 g1:0.25 a1:0.25+ c#2:0.25 a1:0.25/ |

