    | bb1:0.5! bb1:0.25+ f2:0.25 bb1:0.25 a1:0.25+ bb1:0.25 bb1:0.25 a1:0.5! a1:0.25+ e2:0.25 a1:0.25 g1:0.25+ g1:0.25 g1:0.25 |
    | g1:1! g1:0.25+ g1:0.25 bb1:0.5 a1:1! a1:0.25+ bb1:0.25 b1:0.25 c#2:0.25 |
